<title>UKRAINE: HRYVNIA RISES TO 1.855 FROM 1.857 PER DLR IN KIEV.</title>
<headline>HRYVNIA RISES TO 1.855 FROM 1.857 PER DLR IN KIEV.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia edged up to 1.8550 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange from 1.8570 at the previous session.</p>
<p>				    Aug 12		 Aug 11</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar	  1.8550		 1.8570</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $50.93 million	   $7.64 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 244 9150</p>
